 06:58:00', 'title': 'SIMON® AND JAMESTOWN ANNOUNCE CLOSING OF STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP', 'text': 'INDIANAPOLIS AND ATLANTA , DEC. 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SIMON®, A REAL ESTATE INVESTMENT TRUST ENGAGED IN THE OWNERSHIP OF PREMIER SHOPPING, DINING, ENTERTAINMENT, AND MIXED-USE DESTINATIONS, AND JAMESTOWN, A GLOBAL REAL ESTATE INVESTMENT AND MANAGEMENT FIRM, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPLETION OF THEIR PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP.\xa0\xa0 SIMON EXPECTS ITS 50 PERCENT INTEREST IN THIS BEST-IN-CLASS, GLOBAL REAL ESTATE INVESTMENT AND ASSET MANAGEMENT FIRM TO BE ACCRETIVE TO EARNINGS.'}{'symbol': 'SEDG', 'date': '2022-12-19 20:49:00', 'title': 'SOLAREDGE SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT PENDING: CONTACT LEVI & KORSINSKY BEFORE JANUARY 3, 2023 TO DISCUSS YOUR RIGHTS - SEDG', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - DECEMBER 19, 2022) - LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. ("SOLAREDGE" OR THE "COMPANY") (NASDAQ: SEDG) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF SOLAREDGE INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF NEW YORK.'}{'symbol': 'SEDG', 'date': '2022-12-19 19:15:00', 'title': 'ROSEN, LEADING TRIAL ATTORNEYS, ENCOURAGES SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. INVESTORS TO SECURE COUNSEL BEFORE IMPORTANT DEADLINE IN SECURITIES CLASS ACTION - SEDG', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - DECEMBER 19, 2022) - WHY: ROSEN LAW FIRM, A GLOBAL INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, REMINDS PURCHASERS OF THE SECURITIES OF SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NASDAQ: SEDG) BETWEEN AUGUST 6, 2020 AND OCTOBER 19, 2022, BOTH DATES INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"), OF THE IMPORTANT JANUARY 3, 2023 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE.'}{'symbol': 'SEDG', 'date': '2022-12-19 09:41:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ACTION NOTICE: THE SCHALL LAW FIRM ENCOURAGES INVESTORS IN SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. WITH LOSSES OF $100,000 TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, CALIFORNIA--(NEWSFILE CORP. - DECE